    "title": "North Carolina Maritime Museum hosts summer science school amid renovations - NewsBreak",
    "text": "wcti12.com\nwebsite\nBeaufort\nNorth Carolina Maritime Museum hosts summer science school amid renovations\nBy Valentina Wilson,\n6 hours agoWhile the North Carolina Maritime Museum in Beaufort remains closed for construction, the Summer Science School is in full swing at various locations across the town. This week, campers have the opportunity to explore coastal adventures, learning about coastal habitats, the importance of estuaries, marine life, and maritime studies. The program is open to students entering grades 7 through 10, with numerous other programs available through August.",
